Building project rules
Build directory is /w/prj/CloudOffice_third_build 
Set the folowing environment variables before building the project:
QT_QPA_PLATFORM=xcb
PYTHONPATH=$PYTHONPATH:/w/prj/CloudOffice_third/BuildUtils/CMake/Tools
CLOUD_OFFICE_EXTERNALS_ROOT_DIR=/home/dev/COExternals_third
QML_IMPORT_PATH=/w/prj/CloudOffice_second/QtComponents/UIKit/QML/
QML2_IMPORT_PATH=/home/dev/COExternals_second/3rdParty/Install/qt-5.15.10-4-13-linux-x86_64-GNU-10-debug/qml/

Use existing CMakeCache.txt. It it does not exist configure again. Use such command:
cmake -S source_dir -B build_dir \
  -DCO_BUILD_DESKTOP_EDITORS=TRUE \
  -DCO_QT_COMPILER_ID_OVERRIDE=GNU-10 \
  -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=clang \
  -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=clang++ \
  -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug \
  -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=TRUE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_CORE_VERSIONING=FALSE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_DESKTOP_COLLABORATION=TRUE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_ADVANCED_EXTERNAL_REFERENCES=TRUE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_QT_DESKTOP_DIGITAL_SIGNATURE_GOST=FALSE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_BIN_FORMAT_CONVERTER=TRUE \
  -DCO_USE_ASPOSE_LICENSE=FALSE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_CORE_TESTS=FALSE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_DESK_TESTS=FALSE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_EVENTLOGGER=TRUE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_LKSDK=TRUE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_QT_DESKTOP_LK_GUI=TRUE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_PDF_EXPORT=TRUE \
  -DCO_SIGN_ARTEFACTS=OFF \
  -DCO_ENABLE_CRYPTOPROCSP=FALSE \
  -DCO_ENABLED_APPLE_SANDBOX=FALSE \
  -DCO_LKSDK_TEST_ENVIRONMENT=TRUE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_DESKTOP_FILTERING_BY_DATE=TRUE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_CHECK_APP_UPDATES=TRUE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_PIVOT_TABLE_DATA_FILTERING=TRUE \
  -DCO_ENABLE_DESKTOP_STORYBOOK=TRUE \
  -UCO_MANUAL_TESTS \
  -DCO_ENABLE_PERF_TESTS=FALSE && \
cmake --build build_dir --config Debug

Build project after each task with code edits and fix error if the build fails.
Save build log to build_log.txt in the build directory.

Running project rules
Run project with lldb  debugger. If the executable crashes analyze stack trace and coredump file and fix issues. Use the command: lldb -b -o "run" -o "bt" -o "script import os; os._exit(0)" -- ./app_executable
IF the launched app does not exit within 5 minutes, kill the app process.







